{"seq":1,"slug":"performance-optimization","title":"性能优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-micro-frontends/operations/performance-optimization","wordCount":660,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"性能优化\">性能优化</h1><p>微前端天然面临性能挑战：多个独立打包的子应用意味着更多的网络请求、更大的总包体积、以及潜在的重复依赖加载。2026 年 MF 2.0 的性能优化体系覆盖了构建、资源加载、渲染和数据获取四个阶段，配合 Rspack 的极速构建，使微前端应用的性能可以逼近甚至达到单体应用的水平。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>微前端的性能优化需要在四个阶段系统性地发力：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[构建阶段] --&gt; B[资源加载阶段]&#10;    B --&gt; C[渲染阶段]&#10;    C --&gt; D[数据获取阶段]&#10;    A --&gt;|Tree Shaking| A1[减小产物体积]&#10;    B --&gt;|预加载 + 并行| B1[消除瀑布流]&#10;    C --&gt;|SSR + Streaming| C1[加速首屏]&#10;    D --&gt;|Prefetch + Cache| D1[消除等待]\">graph LR\n    A[构建阶段] --&gt; B[资源加载阶段]\n    B --&gt; C[渲染阶段]\n    C --&gt; D[数据获取阶段]\n    A --&gt;|Tree Shaking| A1[减小产物体积]\n    B --&gt;|预加载 + 并行| B1[消除瀑布流]\n    C --&gt;|SSR + Streaming| C1[加速首屏]\n    D --&gt;|Prefetch + Cache| D1[消除等待]</pre><h2 id=\"资源加载优化\">资源加载优化</h2><h3 id=\"预加载-preloading\">预加载（Preloading）</h3><p>MF 1.x 的最大性能问题是瀑布式加载：用户点击导航 → 加载子应用 remoteEntry → 解析依赖 → 加载 chunk → 渲染。MF 2.0 的 preloadRemotes API 在空闲时提前加载：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { preloadRemotes } from &#39;@module-federation/enhanced/runtime&#39;;&#10;&#10;// 用户登录后，空闲时预加载关键子应用&#10;requestIdleCallback(() =&gt; {&#10;  preloadRemotes([&#10;    {&#10;      nameOrAlias: &#39;product&#39;,&#10;      exposes: [&#39;./ProductList&#39;, &#39;./ProductDetail&#39;],&#10;      resourceCategory: &#39;all&#39;, // 预加载 JS + CSS&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      nameOrAlias: &#39;checkout&#39;,&#10;      exposes: [&#39;./CheckoutFlow&#39;],&#10;      resourceCategory: &#39;js&#39;, // 仅预加载 JS&#10;    },&#10;  ]);&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { preloadRemotes } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@module-federation/enhanced/runtime'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 用户登录后，空闲时预加载关键子应用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">requestIdleCallback</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  preloadRemotes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      nameOrAlias: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'product'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      exposes: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./ProductList'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./ProductDetail'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      resourceCategory: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'all'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 预加载 JS + CSS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      nameOrAlias: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'checkout'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      exposes: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./CheckoutFlow'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      resourceCategory: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'js'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 仅预加载 JS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>加载策略</th>\n<th>首次渲染时间</th>\n<th>用户感知</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>无预加载（瀑布流）</td>\n<td>1200-2000ms</td>\n<td>明显白屏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>路由级预加载</td>\n<td>600-800ms</td>\n<td>短暂 loading</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空闲时全量预加载</td>\n<td>100-200ms</td>\n<td>接近瞬时</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"并行加载\">并行加载</h3><p>确保独立的子应用资源并行请求而非串行：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 错误：串行加载&#10;const product = await loadRemote(&#39;product/ProductList&#39;);&#10;const cart = await loadRemote(&#39;cart/CartWidget&#39;);&#10;&#10;// 正确：并行加载&#10;const [product, cart] = await Promise.all([loadRemote(&#39;product/ProductList&#39;), loadRemote(&#39;cart/CartWidget&#39;)]);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 错误：串行加载</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> product</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> loadRemote</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'product/ProductList'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> cart</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> loadRemote</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'cart/CartWidget'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 正确：并行加载</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">product</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cart</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">all</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">loadRemote</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'product/ProductList'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">loadRemote</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'cart/CartWidget'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)]);</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"包体积优化\">包体积优化</h2><h3 id=\"shared-tree-shaking\">Shared Tree Shaking</h3><p>已在共享依赖章节详述。核心要点：对大型组件库（Ant Design、Material UI）开启 <code>treeShaking: true</code>，可减少 70%+ 的 shared bundle 体积。</p>\n<h3 id=\"按需暴露\">按需暴露</h3><p>Remote 不要暴露整个入口，而是按消费需求暴露最小粒度：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 错误：暴露整个应用&#10;exposes: { &#39;./App&#39;: &#39;./src/App&#39; }&#10;&#10;// 正确：暴露具体组件/hook&#10;exposes: {&#10;  &#39;./ProductList&#39;: &#39;./src/components/ProductList&#39;,&#10;  &#39;./ProductDetail&#39;: &#39;./src/components/ProductDetail&#39;,&#10;  &#39;./useProduct&#39;: &#39;./src/hooks/useProduct&#39;,&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 错误：暴露整个应用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">exposes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./App'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./src/App'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 正确：暴露具体组件/hook</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">exposes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  './ProductList'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./src/components/ProductList'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  './ProductDetail'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./src/components/ProductDetail'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  './useProduct'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./src/hooks/useProduct'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"代码分割协调\">代码分割协调</h3><p>子应用内部的动态 import 与 MF 的异步加载配合使用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 子应用内部的路由级分割&#10;const ProductDetail = lazy(() =&gt; import(&#39;./pages/ProductDetail&#39;));&#10;const ProductReviews = lazy(() =&gt; import(&#39;./pages/ProductReviews&#39;));\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 子应用内部的路由级分割</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ProductDetail</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> lazy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./pages/ProductDetail'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ProductReviews</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> lazy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./pages/ProductReviews'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"首屏性能-ssr-与流式渲染\">首屏性能：SSR 与流式渲染</h2><p>MF 2.0 对 SSR 的支持消除了微前端与首屏性能的历史矛盾：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// Modern.js 中使用 MF SSR&#10;// host-app/modern.config.ts&#10;export default defineConfig({&#10;  runtime: { router: true },&#10;  server: { ssr: true },&#10;  plugins: [&#10;    moduleFederationPlugin({&#10;      name: &#39;host&#39;,&#10;      remotes: {&#10;        product: &#39;product@https://product.example.com/mf-manifest.json&#39;,&#10;      },&#10;    }),&#10;  ],&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Modern.js 中使用 MF SSR</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// host-app/modern.config.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> defineConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  runtime: { router: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  server: { ssr: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  plugins: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    moduleFederationPlugin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'host'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      remotes: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        product: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'product@https://product.example.com/mf-manifest.json'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p>流式渲染配合 React 19 的 <code>renderToPipeableStream</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 服务端渲染入口&#10;import { renderToPipeableStream } from &#39;react-dom/server&#39;;&#10;&#10;app.get(&#39;*&#39;, (req, res) =&gt; {&#10;  const { pipe } = renderToPipeableStream(&lt;App url={req.url} /&gt;, {&#10;    bootstrapScripts: [&#39;/client.js&#39;],&#10;    onShellReady() {&#10;      res.setHeader(&#39;Content-Type&#39;, &#39;text/html&#39;);&#10;      pipe(res); // 流式传输，Shell 先到，子应用内容后续到达&#10;    },&#10;  });&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 服务端渲染入口</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { renderToPipeableStream } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'react-dom/server'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">app.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'*'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">req</span><span style=\